<title>BRAZIL: Brazil aluminium output marginally down in July.</title>
<headline>Brazil aluminium output marginally down in July.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian production of primary aluminium totaled 101,100 tonnes in July, just slightly below the 101,700 tonnes produced in July 1996, the Brazilian Aluminium Association (ABAL) said in a statement.</p>
<p>Production in the first seven months of this year was also marginally down on last year, reaching 691,900 tonnes, down 0.6 percent on the 696,000 tonnes produced in January/July 1996.</p>
<p>((-Caroline Bulloch, Rio de Janeiro newsroom, 5521 5074151))</p>
